{"id":"b0214c7ec3ea52ef","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-induction-schema.md","title":"Induction Schema","display":"df-induction-schema — Induction Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-induction-schema","aliases":["92-df-induction-schema"],"display":"df-induction-schema — Induction Schema","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-substitution]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 29–30；第 X 章 pp. 112–113（PDF 46–47、129–130）","source_status":"原书归纳的本地呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-induction-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-induction-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-induction-schema — Induction Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 29–30；第 X 章 pp. 112–113（PDF 46–47、129–130）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书归纳的本地呈现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable symbol, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (capture-avoiding substitution, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula class used to restrict the schema)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IndInst}_G,\\mathrm{Ind}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{IndInst}_G,\\mathrm{Ind}_G\\)</span> (definition-target induction-instance and schema constructors)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IndInst}_G&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IndInst}_G(\\varphi,x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,0,x)\\land\n\\forall x\\bigl(\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,S(x),x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_G(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{IndInst}_G(\\varphi,x)\\mid\\varphi\\in C,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IndInst}_G&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IndInst}_G(\\varphi,x)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,0,x)\\land\n\\forall x\\bigl(\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,S(x),x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_G(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{IndInst}_G(\\varphi,x)\\mid\\varphi\\in C,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}\\)</span> : 数学归纳公理模式</li>\n<li>对任意公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>，有对应的归纳公理</li>\n<li>这是一个公理&quot;模式&quot;，生成无限多条公理</li>\n<li>基础情况：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(0)\">\\(\\varphi(0)\\)</span></li>\n<li>归纳步骤：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x) \\to \\varphi(S(x))\">\\(\\varphi(x) \\to \\varphi(S(x))\\)</span></li>\n<li>结论：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 可以含有除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 外的自由参数，所以单个实例一般是公式而不一定是句子；需要句子公理时取其余自由变量的全称闭包</li>\n<li>归纳公理是PA的核心，证明算术性质</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本地 IndInst 用一般无捕获替换。原书 N₁₂ 用额外变量的等式 wrapper 表示后继实例以简化算术化。公式参数须保留；一阶归纳只涉及语言可表达集合，完整二阶归纳量化所有集合。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 III 章 pp. 29–30；第 X 章 pp. 112–113（PDF 46–47、129–130）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variable symbol, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subst}_G$ (capture-avoiding substitution, see [[92-df-substitution]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IndInst}_G,\\mathrm{Ind}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IndInst}_G&:\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathrm{Var}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\\\\n\\mathrm{IndInst}_G(\\varphi,x)&\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,0,x)\\land\n\\forall x\\bigl(\\varphi\\to\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,S(x),x)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\to\\forall x\\,\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Ind}_G(C)&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{IndInst}_G(\\varphi,x)\\mid\\varphi\\in C,\\ x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x) \\to \\varphi(S(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":2174,"backlinks":[{"id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_G$ (induction-schema constructor, see [[92-df-induction-schema]])"},{"id":"ea47eabc51d9439c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_G$ (restricted induction-schema constructor, see [[92-df-induction-schema]])"},{"id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9fd00b865071e121","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\mathrm{Fml}_G)$ (full induction-schema set, see [[92-df-induction-schema]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-induction-schema]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-induction-schema]]"}],"outgoing":["5a1bd470754681a7","d666a3e3ee6c8148","725c1f1651ce9a00"]}